---
permalink: /sitemap.xml
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
{%- comment -%}
site.pages also carries the stylesheet, its source map, robots.txt and the .bib.
Every real page has a trailing slash (permalink: pretty), so that is the filter;
`sitemap: false` in front matter opts a page out on top of it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign items = site.pages | concat: site.projects | concat: site.posts -%}
{%- for item in items -%}
{%- assign tail = item.url | slice: -1 -%}
{%- if tail == '/' and item.sitemap != false %}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ item.url | absolute_url }}</loc>
    {%- if item.date %}
    <lastmod>{{ item.date | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
    {%- endif %}
  </url>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
</urlset>
